# market-terminal — optional free API keys.
#
# Copy this file to .env (same folder) and fill in any keys you register.
# Keys can ALSO be pasted in the app under SET -> API KEYS (stored in the
# local SQLite db); a value saved in SET wins over the .env value.
# The app works with ZERO keys: yahoo (delayed quotes/charts/news) and
# SEC EDGAR (official statements/dividends) are keyless, demo covers the rest.

# Finnhub — near-real-time US quotes + websocket trades, insider
# transactions, analyst ratings, earnings, IPO calendar.
# Free tier: 60 req/min. Sign up: https://finnhub.io/register
MKT_KEY_FINNHUB=

# marketaux — financial news with entity tagging and sentiment scores.
# Free tier: 100 req/day, 3 articles/response. https://www.marketaux.com/register
MKT_KEY_MARKETAUX=

# FRED (St. Louis Fed) — official US economic release calendar.
# Free key: https://fredaccount.stlouisfed.org/apikeys
MKT_KEY_FRED=

# Alpha Vantage — statements backup for non-US filers.
# Free tier: 25 req/day. https://www.alphavantage.co/support/#api-key
MKT_KEY_ALPHAVANTAGE=
